<title>UK: Unibanco unit sets $100 mln one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Unibanco unit sets $100 mln one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNIBANCO, ACTING THROUGH GRAND CAYMAN BRANCH</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    06.NOV.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    06.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  20 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+140 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
